      <h2>Rating Dynamics and Their Impact on Outcomes</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="section-body">
      <p>Player ratings follow a bell-curve distribution centered around <strong>1,597 Elo (white) and 1,589 Elo (black)</strong>, with a standard deviation of 291 for both colors. The slight discrepancy in means reflects normal sampling variation rather than systematic bias.</p>

